          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "धावणे (dhāvṇe) is a tadbhava, a word inherited from Sanskrit and reshaped by sound change. It comes from dhāvati, \"runs, flows\" (CDIAL 6802)."
